==================================================
2. PROJECT OBJECTIVE
====================

FinGuard – TrustFlow addresses common transparency problems in cross-border payments experienced by Indian freelancers receiving payments from international clients.

Problems to address:

* Unclear transaction fees.
* Uncertain currency conversion rates.
* Difficulty understanding the final recipient amount.
* Lack of transparent transaction tracking.
* Difficulty verifying transaction records.
* Limited visibility into payment status and transaction history.

The application should allow users to create payment requests, obtain fee estimates, review currency conversion assumptions, track transaction status, and verify relevant blockchain records.

This is a fintech demonstration application.

It must not falsely claim to perform actual international bank transfers.

Unless an authorized real payment provider is separately integrated, all payment settlement must be clearly identified as simulated.

Blockchain verification and simulated payment settlement must be treated as separate operations.

